# Quantum Edge Markets Client Portal API

Node.js and Express backend using PostgreSQL.

## Database

Run schema.sql in your PostgreSQL/Supabase SQL editor.

## Install

npm install

## Start

npm start

## Required environment variables

DATABASE_URL=your-postgresql-connection-string

JWT_SECRET=your-long-random-secret

FRONTEND_URL=https://your-github-pages-site

NODE_ENV=production

PORT=3000

## API endpoints

GET /api/health

POST /api/auth/signup

POST /api/auth/login

GET /api/me

PUT /api/me

POST /api/withdrawals

GET /api/withdrawals

## Security

Never put DATABASE_URL or JWT_SECRET inside the frontend HTML.

Financial account values should only be changed through authorized server-side administration.
